@startuml
title US-08 DFD: View Borrow History & Evidence
left to right direction
skinparam roundcorner 12

rectangle "User (Participant / Outsider)" as User
usecase "8.1\nAuthorize\nParticipant" as P1
usecase "8.2\nAggregate Timeline\n& Proofs" as P2
database "D3: BorrowRequests" as D3
database "D4: Transactions" as D4
database "D5: Evidence & Storage" as D5

User --> P1 : Query by borrower or item
D3 --> P1 : Request parties
D4 --> P1 : Lender & Borrower IDs
P1 --> P2 : Authorized participant
D4 --> P2 : Loan timestamps & status
D5 --> P2 : Handover & return proofs
P2 --> User : History timeline / 403 Forbidden
@enduml
